adapter sequence not known 
sequencing data is from 1000G round2 batch1_2 PCR5104 barcode01

ConSeqUMI uses Starcode software to cluster the UMI sequences based on Levensthein distance similarity. This should drastically improve memory efficiency for short sequences 
(short is not specified in bps).

After clustering, chimeric sequences are identified and removed using the same procedure as Karst et al. 
The reference free approach doesn't make any assumptions about target length, which could cause problems and increases complexity of chimera detection. 


